# SSH deploy keys and stray secret/token files (NEVER commit)
# `.env.token` was tracked from 604d5fb until 2026-08-06 — a real TENANT_ADMIN
# JWT, expired 2026-02-07 and therefore dead, but signed with the dev
# JWT_SECRET_KEY that is still live. Nothing stopped it being regenerated and
# re-committed, which is how it survived adca382's sweep for exactly this.
.env.token
gito_staging_deploy_new
gito_staging_deploy_new.pub
token.txt
*.pem
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

