# Mobile app (Expo / React Native). `mobile/` itself is deliberately TRACKED —
# the previous app vanished because it never was. These are its build artifacts,
# listed before the app lands rather than after the first accidental commit of
# a node_modules tree. Not Flutter paths: `.dart_tool/` and `mobile/build/` would
# be the old stack, and `build/` above already covers the latter anyway.
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/.expo/
mobile/.expo-shared/
mobile/dist/
mobile/web-build/
mobile/*.tsbuildinfo

# Keep example files
!.env.example
!.github/
nul


